- Per-tenant RBAC using Azure AD
- PII redaction via Text Analytics
- Prompt ownership governed by a policy registry
- Canary-based prompt rollouts and end-to-end testing with synthetic tenants

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo-implementation: tenant-scoped lookup and prompt assembly
async function respond(tenantId, userQuery){
  const kb = await kbClient.getTenantKB(tenantId);
  const prompt = buildPrompt(tenantId, userQuery, kb);
  const redacted = await piiRedactor.redact(userQuery);
  const res = await openai.complete({prompt});
  await logMetrics(tenantId, res);
